// Stress / red-line pin: bind a record, share it across several bindings, then
// update one path. Value semantics guarantees the shared original is unchanged
// no matter how many bindings read it (proposal-value-semantics-mvp §3.4). The
// eval == run differential is the oracle; here the harness reads the shared
// original back directly.
def r = #{ x = 1, y = 2 };
def a = r;
def b = r;
def updated = #{ r | x = 99 };

a

//@ expect-last-value: #{x = 1, y = 2}
